<title>UK: CSFB adds 50 mln marks to Venezuala linked bond. [CORRECTED 14:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>CSFB adds 50 mln marks to Venezuala linked bond. [CORRECTED 14:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to make clear the bond was increased by 50 million marks and not 100 million marks)</p>
<p>The following Venezuala credit-linked bond announced earlier by lead manager CSFB-Effectenbank, has been increased by 50 million marks.</p>
<p>There are new issue and reoffer prices.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SYNTHETIC SOVEREIGN INVESTMENT JERSEY LTD</p>
<p> AMT   *150 MLN DEM   COUPON     11.50     MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    11.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    100.0     LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DEGOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.25	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	UNDERLYING BONDS ARE VENEZUALA DCBS DUE 18.DEC.07</p>
<p>	     *ORIGINALLY 100 MLN DEM</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
